## Lane A — the boxed inequality, and the history-free fork

The target was the literal estimate

    |𝓑_K(u) − 𝓑_K(v)| ≤ q|u − v|,  q < 1,  u = g⁻²,
    𝓑_K(u) = Σ_{j<K} β_j(g_j(u), h_j(u)),

on the admissible small-field tube.

### What was already in place

The repository already carried the whole chain in its *memory-bearing* form:

