### What this round adds

`RowAHistoryFreeBeta.lean` records the strategic fork explicitly.  In the
source normalisation the Gaussian shell coefficient `β_Z` and the five channel
data are attached to the *scale* `j`, not to the bare inverse coupling: the bare
coupling reaches the shell coefficient only through the running coupling `g_j`,
which the shooting recursion already tracks as an explicit scalar.  Whenever
that is so — the hypotheses `hZfree`, `hDfree`, `hGfree`, `hIfree`, `hCfree`,
`hLfree` — the memory sector is *empty*, and:

* `literalKernelMass_history_free` — the total response mass is exactly the
